{"number":90,"nameArabic":"سُورَةُ البَلَدِ","nameEnglish":"Al-Balad","englishMeaning":"The City","revelationType":"Meccan","totalVerses":20,"audioUrl":"https://server8.mp3quran.net/afs/090.mp3","ayahs":[{"numberInSurah":1,"globalNumber":6024,"arabic":"بِسْمِ ٱللَّهِ ٱلرَّحْمَٰنِ ٱلرَّحِيمِ لَآ أُقْسِمُ بِهَٰذَا ٱلْبَلَدِ","translation":"I swear by this city, Makkah -","transliteration":"Laaa uqsimu bihaazal balad","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/6024.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":2,"globalNumber":6025,"arabic":"وَأَنتَ حِلٌّۢ بِهَٰذَا ٱلْبَلَدِ","translation":"And you, [O Muhammad], are free of restriction in this city -","transliteration":"Wa anta hillum bihaazal balad","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/6025.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":3,"globalNumber":6026,"arabic":"وَوَالِدٍۢ وَمَا وَلَدَ","translation":"And [by] the father and that which was born [of him],","transliteration":"Wa waalidinw wa maa walad","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/6026.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":4,"globalNumber":6027,"arabic":"لَقَدْ خَلَقْنَا ٱلْإِنسَٰنَ فِى كَبَدٍ","translation":"We have certainly created man into hardship.","transliteration":"Laqad khalaqnal insaana fee kabad","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/6027.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":5,"globalNumber":6028,"arabic":"أَيَحْسَبُ أَن لَّن يَقْدِرَ عَلَيْهِ أَحَدٌۭ","translation":"Does he think that never will anyone overcome him?","transliteration":"Ayahsabu al-lai yaqdira 'alaihi ahad","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/6028.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":6,"globalNumber":6029,"arabic":"يَقُولُ أَهْلَكْتُ مَالًۭا لُّبَدًا","translation":"He says, \"I have spent wealth in abundance.\"","transliteration":"Yaqoolu ahlaktu maalal lubadaa","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/6029.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":7,"globalNumber":6030,"arabic":"أَيَحْسَبُ أَن لَّمْ يَرَهُۥٓ أَحَدٌ