mp3"},{"numberInSurah":15,"globalNumber":6038,"arabic":"يَتِيمًۭا ذَا مَقْرَبَةٍ","translation":"An orphan of near relationship","transliteration":"Yateeman zaa maqrabah","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/6038.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":16,"globalNumber":6039,"arabic":"أَوْ مِسْكِينًۭا ذَا مَتْرَبَةٍۢ","translation":"Or a needy person in misery","transliteration":"Aw miskeenan zaa matrabah","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/6039.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":17,"globalNumber":6040,"arabic":"ثُمَّ كَانَ مِنَ ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ وَتَوَاصَوْا۟ بِٱلصَّبْرِ وَتَوَاصَوْا۟ بِٱلْمَرْحَمَةِ","translation":"And then being among those who believed and advised one another to patience and advised one another to compassion.","transliteration":"Summa kaana minal lazeena aamanoo wa tawaasaw bissabri wa tawaasaw bilmarhamah","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/6040.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":18,"globalNumber":6041,"arabic":"أُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ أَصْحَٰبُ ٱلْمَيْمَنَةِ","translation":"Those are the companions of the right.","transliteration":"Ulaaa'ika As-haabul maimanah","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/6041.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":19,"globalNumber":6042,"arabic":"وَٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا۟ بِـَٔايَٰتِنَا هُمْ أَصْحَٰبُ ٱلْمَشْـَٔمَةِ","translation":"But they who disbelieved in Our signs - those are the companions of the left.","transliteration":"Wallazeena kafaroo bi aayaatinaa hum as-haabul Mash'amah","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/6042.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":20,"globalNumber":6043,"arabic":"عَلَيْهِمْ نَارٌۭ مُّؤْصَدَةٌۢ","translation":"Over them will be fire closed in.","transliteration":"Alaihim naarum mu'sadah","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/6043.mp3"}]}